# Zoetic Glyph on an artifact that is already a creature: the Ornithopter (an Artifact Creature, Thopter, 0/2 with flying) gets the Golem type as well and base power and
# toughness 5/4 (CR 613.4b), keeping its creature type and its ability. A Lightning Bolt for 3 leaves the 5/4 alive (damage 3 is less than 4), so the Glyph stays on the
# battlefield and discovers nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Zoetic Glyph
Ornithopter
Island
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

